version: "1.6"
date-released: "2026-08-26"
type: software
abstract: "Reproducibility package for a post-selection N-body audit case study beyond Neptune. The archive preserves the historical candidate screen, frozen validation protocols, REBOUND code, canonical and recovered artifacts, execution logs, and SHA-256 provenance records. It is a methods/reproducibility case study and does not report evidence for an undiscovered planet."
repository-code: "https://github.com/caudell15-ai/post-selection-nbody-audit"
